# GUARD ts-snapshot-commit-fence
#
# Advancing authority on an invalidation paired old visible tab positions with
# the engine's new revision. The break restores that early revision assignment;
# only the accepted replacement snapshot may commit a positional fence.
test: navigation waits for snapshot commit before advancing positional fences
